TARGET: lib/spec-from-lock.js
REASON: A crafted package-lock.json can carry file/link specifiers that escape the project root (`file:../../../../tmp/x`, an absolute path, a Windows drive path), and upstream trusts them blindly. cdxgen parses untrusted lockfiles, so every resolution a lockfile entry produces must stay inside the scanned project; an escaping candidate is refused the same way an unparseable one is.

---
